# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007005> (cardiogenic splanchnic mesoderm)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "XAO:0000235") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "http://www.drugs.com/dict/cardiogenic-mesoderm.html") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "https://github.com/obophenotype/insect_neuroanatomy_ontology/issues/7") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007005> "The splanchnic mesoderm in the cardiogenic region where the heart develops; it gives rise to endocardial heart tubes that fuse to form the primordial cardiac tube, the heart primordium[web]. Two migratory heart primordia that move ventrally during the course of neurulation, and then fuse[XAO].")
