# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007106> (chorionic villus)

AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "BTO:0001161") Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Wikipedia:Chorionic_villi") <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007106> "One of the minute vascular projections of the fetal chorion that combines with maternal uterine tissue to form the placenta.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000008> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007106> "The mouse and human placentas have labyrinthine and villous types of interdigitation between maternal and fetal tissues, respectively")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBPROP_0000010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007106> "The bulk of the villi consist of connective tissues in which blood vessels are found. Most of the cells in the connective tissue core of the villi are fibroblasts. Macrophages known as Hofbauer cells are also present.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/UBERON_0007106> "BTO:0001161")
